I'm pleased to have gotten so many responses! Usually people don't
seem to have much to say around here.

Here are my thoughts on the discussion so far:

> Yeah, about that, i don't like it at all. Yeenoghu is going to be far
> more dangerous now, because he can paralyze and is covetous. So, if he
> is generated by some reason, you are pretty much dead.

This is the kind of thing that makes me a bit unsure about the mc
change. I don't want to introduce insurmountable challenges which just
cause any character to die due to nothing more than bad luck. But I
don't think Yeenoghu will be quite that bad. He respects Elbereth and
his paralyze is blocked by free action.


